e=\"padding:6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.7;\">\n                    🛠️ Practice building small workflows hands-on in n8n\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 0; font-size:14px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.7;\">\n                    💬 Ask questions in the WhatsApp group — we're happy to help\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- CTA -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px 40px; text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/C5ksQ7Llj604oXUh9Uhao1\" target=\"_blank\"\n                 style=\"background-color:#111827; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; padding:14px 40px; border-radius:8px; display:inline-block;\">\n                Ask a Question in the Group\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Closing -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 40px 10px;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#4B5563; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 18px;\">\n                We believe in your potential, and we're rooting for your success on the next\n                attempt. Keep practicing, and you'll get there.\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"font-size:15px; color:#111827; margin:20px 0 0; font-weight:600;\">\n                Stay motivated — see you at the re-exam! 💪\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:35px 40px; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align:center;\">\n              <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#111827; margin:0; font-weight:600;\">\n                Warm regards\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n\n        <p style=\"font-size:12px; color:#9CA3AF; margin-top:22px;\">\n          This email was sent because you attempted the certification exam for the n8n Course of Automation.\n        </p>\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
